{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04493","headline":"同旻上人伤寿安傅少府 · 陈子昂","name":"同旻上人伤寿安傅少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生涯良浩浩，天命固谆谆。\n闻道神仙尉，怀德遂爲邻。\n畴昔逢尧日，衣冠仕汉辰。\n交游纷若凤，词翰宛如麟。\n太息劳黄绶，长思谒紫宸。\n金兰徒有契，玉树已埋尘。\n把臂虽无托，平生固亦亲。\n援琴一流涕，旧馆几沾巾。\n杳杳泉中夜，悠悠世上春。\n幽明长隔此，歌哭爲何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}